Code for my Master's Thesis.
Currently working on White Dwarfs in Open Clusters.

Install:
    git clone --recurse-submodules https://github.com/anonzerg/Code.git && cd Code
    python3 -m venv .venv
    source .venv/bin/active
    pip install -r requirements.txt
    pip install ./ezpadova

Run:
    ./main.py -h

contact: anonzerg@proton.me
